### Get Account Balance
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts/100024

### Deposit Request
PUT http://localhost:8080/transactions/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": 100028,
  "amount": 1500.00
}

### Withdraw Request
PUT http://localhost:8080/transactions/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": 100023,
  "amount": 750.00
}

### Find Transaction Request
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions?accountNumber=100015&transactionId=127

### Find Account Transaction History
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/100015

### Transfer Request
PUT http://localhost:8080/transactions/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderAccount": 100015,
  "recipientAccount": 100015,
  "amount": 1500.00
}

### Transactions By Date Request
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/100015/2026-10-10

### Deposit History Request
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/deposits/100015

### Withdraw History Request
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/withdraws/100015
